media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcSet="https://s.hdnux.com/photos/01/21/22/47/21309912/10/1080x0.webp"/><source type="image/webp" media="(min-width: 784px)" srcSet="https://s.hdnux.com/photos/01/21/22/47/21309912/10/960x0.webp"/><source type="image/webp" media="(min-width: 768px)" srcSet="https://s.hdnux.com/photos/01/21/22/47/21309912/10/720x0.webp"/><source type="image/webp" media="(min-width: 768px)" srcSet="https://s.hdnux.com/photos/01/21/22/47/21309912/10/960x0.webp"/><source type="image/webp" media="(min-width: 720px)" srcSet="https://s.hdnux.com/photos/01/21/22/47/21309912/10/768x0.webp"/><source type="image/webp" media="(min-width: 640px)" srcSet="https://s.hdnux.com/photos/01/21/22/47/21309912/10/720x0.webp"/><source type="image/webp" media="(min-width: 480px)" srcSet="https://s.hdnux.com/photos/01/21/22/47/21309912/10/640x0.webp"/><source type="image/webp" media="(min-width: 360px)" srcSet="https://s.hdnux.com/photos/01/21/22/47/21309912/10/480x0.webp"/><source type="image/webp" media="(min-width: 240px)" srcSet="https://s.hdnux.com/photos/01/21/22/47/21309912/10/360x0.webp"/><source type="image/webp" media="(max-width: 239px)" srcSet="https://s.hdnux.com/photos/01/21/22/47/21309912/10/240x0.webp"/><img alt="Abdul Osmanu" loading="lazy" srcSet="https://s.hdnux.com/photos/01/21/22/47/21309912/10/80x0.jpg 80w, https://s.hdnux.com/photos/01/21/22/47/21309912/10/160x0.jpg 160w, https://s.hdnux.com/photos/01/21/22/47/21309912/10/240x0.jpg 240w, https://s.hdnux.com/photos/01/21/22/47/21309912/10/360x0.jpg 360w, https://s.hdnux.com/photos/01/21/22/47/21309912/10/480x0.jpg 480w, https://s.hdnux.com/photos/01/21/22/47/21309912/10/640x0.jpg 640w, https://s.hdnux.com/photos/01/21/22/47/21309912/10/720x0.jpg 720w, https://s.hdnux.com/photos/01/21/22/47/21309912/10/960x0.jpg 960w, https://s.hdnux.com/photos/01/21/22/47/21309912/10/1080x0.jpg 1080w, https://s.hdnux.com/photos/01/21/22/47/21309912/10/1440x0.jpg 1440w, https://s.hdnux.com/photos/01/21/22/47/21309912/10/1920x0.jpg 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 1200px) 1440px, 100vw" style="aspect-ratio:3 / 2" class="x100 y100 opc bgpc ofcv bgscv block bg-black mnh0px fill"/></picture></div><div class="bgt rel vv o100 y32px"></div><figcaption id="mediaCaptionAria" class="f fdc g2 rel px20 sm:px0 td300 ttfeio tdl300 o0 rel"><span class="photoCaption c-gray700 block oy-hidden mh46px"><div data-server-side-rendered="true" class="r12zgbl0 ruduv2y"><p>Abdul Osmanu</p></div></span><span class="photoCredit c-gray600 block rel z1 mt2 p4ywqby mnh24px"><span>Rhonda Caldwell / Contributed photo</span></span></figcaption></figure></div></section><div class="pb20"><div id="everlit-auto-audio-widget" data-eid="item-103134" data-publication-id="pblc_0V8EKnUa3NJ" style="height:130px" class="x100 tac fs16"></div></div><div class="r1udwkp5 d1uy5mhj articleBody mb32" data-block-type="text" data-dropcap="false"><p>HAMDEN — Not much more than a year ago, she was a Hamden High School senior serving as the student representative to the Board of Education.</p></div><div data-eid="item-100646" id="" class="mb32 ar16-9 isolate z0 rel"><img src="https://cdn-channels-pixel.ex.co/events/0012000001fxZm9AAE?integrationType=DEFAULT&amp;template=design%2Farticle%2Fplatypus_two_column.tpl" alt="" class="x1px y1px vh abs" aria-hidden="true" width="1" height="1"/><div id="ae9d7b65-bf2a-4878-8302-0d08f315ae17" multiple=""></div></div><div class="r1udwkp5 d1uy5mhj articleBody mb32" data-block-type="text" data-dropcap="false"><p>Now, 19-year-old Mariam Khan hopes to be elected as a full-fledged board member.</p></div><div class="pt16 sy16 bb bt b-gray300 mb32"><div class=""><p class="uiHeader11 f aic jcc ttu">Advertisement</p><p class="uiTextSmall f aic jcc">Article continues below this ad</p></div><div data-block-type="ad" data-small-id="A300" data-large-id="Inline-1" data-unit="hnp-nhregister.com/article_dtc" class="f jcc mnh250px sm:mnh600px ais lg:f lg:jcc lg:mnh250px lg:pb16 lg:aic"></div></div><div></div><div class="r1udwkp5 d1uy5mhj articleBody mb32" data-block-type="text" data-dropcap="false"><p>She’s the youngest candidate out of everyone confirmed to be running, but not by much. Abdul Osmanu, also 19, is seeking the 3rd District Legislative Council seat.</p></div><div class="r1udwkp5 d1uy5mhj articleBody mb32" data-block-type="text" data-dropcap="false"><p>Vera Morrison, who has served as town clerk for 26 years, said that, as far as she can remember, the last person close to that age to run for municipal office was Mayor Curt Balzano Leng. Leng first ran for the Legislative Council in 1995, when he was 20, he said.</p></div><div class="r1udwkp5 d1uy5mhj articleBody mb32" data-block-type="text" data-dropcap="false"><p>The Democratic Town Committee endorsed Khan and Osmanu last week.</p></div><div class="mb32"><div class="x100 bg-white f fdc aic mxa p20 deep br4"><div class="f fdc aic mb10"><div class="f aic jcc"><div class="f aic"><div id="badge-logo"><svg viewBox="0 0 101 100" width="50" height="50" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="y100 be1f59o" role="img" aria-label="New Haven Register Logo"><desc>New Haven Register Logo</desc><use href="#logosource-new-haven-register-badge"></use></svg></div></div><div class="pl10 pr10"><svg width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 13" class="p0"><path id="Path 5" d="M2.50195 2.00183L11.4983 10.9981" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round"></path><path id="Path 5_2" d="M2.50195 10.9982L11.4983 2.00187" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></div><svg width="40" height="40" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="p0"><path d="M23.7449 12.27C23.7449 11.48 23.6749 10.73 23.5549 10H12.2549V14.51H18.7249C18.4349 15.99 17.5849 17.24 16.3249 18.09V21.09H20.1849C22.4449 19 23.7449 15.92 23.7449 12.27Z" fill="#4285F4"></path><path d="M12.2549 24C15.4949 24 18.2049 22.92 20.1849 21.09L16.3249 18.09C15.2449 18.81 13.8749 19.25 12.2549 19.25C9.12492 19.25 6.47492 17.14 5.52492 14.29H1.54492V17.38C3.51492 21.3 7.56492 24 12.2549 24Z" fill="#34A853"></path><path d="M5.52488 14.29C5.27488 13.57 5.14488 12.8 5.14488 12C5.14488 11.2 5.28488 10.43 5.52488 9.71V6.62H1.54488C0.724882 8.24 0.254883 10.06 0.254883 12C0.254883 13.94 0.724882 15.76 1.54488 17.38L5.52488 14.29Z" fill="#FBBC05"></path><path d="M12.2549 4.75C14.0249 4.75 15.6049 5.36 16.8549 6.55L20.2749 3.13C18.2049 1.19 15.4949 0 12.2549 0C7.56492 0 3.51492 2.7 1.54492 6.62L5.52492 9.71C6.47492 6.86 9.12492 4.75 12.2549 4.75Z" fill="#EA4335"></path></svg></div></div><h3 class="uiHeader8 tac fs18 mb12 sm:fs23 sm:uiHeader4"><div data-block-type="text" data-server-side-rendered="true" class="r12zgbl0 ruduv2y">Want more New Haven Register?</div></h3><div data-block-type="text" data-server-side-rendered="true" class="r12zgbl0 ruduv2y uiTextMedium tac c-gray700 mb16">Make us a Preferred Source on Google to see more of us when you search.</div><a href="https://www.google.com/preferences/source?q=nhregister.com" data-link="native" role="button" aria-label="Add Preferred Source" class="td300 cp f aic jcc disabled:cd wsn px24 y40px px16 py8 buttonSm fs13 xs:fs16 xs:buttonLg bg-primaryAccessible hover:o80 c-white disabled:bg-gray300 disabled:c-gray600 border bn tac br2"><div data-block-type="text" data-server-side-rendered="true" class="r12zgbl0 ruduv2y">Add Preferred Source</div></a></div></div><div class="r1udwkp5 d1uy5mhj articleBody mb32" data-block-type="text" data-dropcap="false"><p>Both are in undergraduate political science programs — Khan at Yale University and Osmanu at Southern Connecticut State University. Khan also said she studies biology, and Osmanu said he studies sociology.</p></div><div class="md:pt16 md:sy16 md:bb md:bt b-gray300 mb32"><div class="vh y0 mb0 md:vv md:y100 md:mb16"><p class="uiHeader11 f aic jcc ttu">Advertisement</p><p class="uiTextSmall f aic jcc">Article continues below this ad</p></div><div data-block-type="ad" data-small-id="NTV7ARD" data-la